# 2026-10-19 d308d: where is the 52.71 ms frame? Same 8 casts twice in one 45 s frames run, each cast marked.
# Pass 1 = first use, pass 2 = warm. A spike only in pass 1 at a mark = first-use stall (warmup Spec). Spikes anywhere / with gc = editor or GC noise.
# Output: frames report (slowest five with the mark before each) + Tools/Unity/Stage308_ops/logs/frames_last.csv.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:10
?call SpellLab308 Run lock:Dummy_10m
sleep 2
?call PlayProbe308 Run log:reset
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:46
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:idle
sleep 4
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:ga1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uAC00
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:go1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uACE0
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:no1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:so1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uC18C
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:mo1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uBAA8
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:mong1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uBABD
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:on1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uC628
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:neom1
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB118
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:ga2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uAC00
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:go2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uACE0
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:no2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:so2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uC18C
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:mo2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uBAA8
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:mong2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uBABD
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:on2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uC628
sleep 2.5
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames:mark:neom2
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB118
sleep 2.5
sleep 3
?call PlayProbe308 Run frames
?call PlayProbe308 Run log
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run strike:off
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
